(7570430, 1214912, 67258, '<td valign="top">This was my favourite of the challenge ( I was your 10).</td>', 'This was my favourite of the challenge ( I was your 10).', '2018-06-06 06:11:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7570434, 1215117, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> thanks for the translation, mita. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I tried</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: thanks for the translation, mita.  I tried', '2018-06-06 08:20:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7570449, 1215091, 173844, '<td valign="top">My comment didn''t make it through, doubtless due to not hitting a key.<br/>I don''t know how Kodachrome this is, but it''s very pretty and tranquil. The muted colors draw one in.  Interesting how the reflected masts and rigging are more prominent than the actual objects.  Just to view this image slows one''s breathing.</td>', 'My comment didn''t make it through, doubtless due to not hitting a key.I don''t know how Kodachrome this is, but it''s very pretty and tranquil. The muted colors draw one in.  Interesting how the reflected masts and rigging are more prominent than the actual objects.  Just to view this image slows one''s breathing.', '2018-06-06 12:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
