(7570481, 1215091, 19959, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the comments... I realize that this is not the perfect candidate for the challenge. It was very muted due to the mist and I used the Kodachrome filter in NIK Color Efex Pro to convert it which gave a little more ''pop''<br/>I had to leave this location at 6:00am which is a shame because very soon afterwards the sun broke through the mist and would have made an interesting scene...</td>', 'Thanks all for the comments... I realize that this is not the perfect candidate for the challenge. It was very muted due to the mist and I used the Kodachrome filter in NIK Color Efex Pro to convert it which gave a little more ''pop''I had to leave this location at 6:00am which is a shame because very soon afterwards the sun broke through the mist and would have made an interesting scene...', '2018-06-06 17:37:23.000000', NULL, 0),
