(7570636, 1215098, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>You''ve struck the right note with the warm vibrant colours of the flower very typical Kodachrome. I like your off-centre composition it works well and is nicely isolated from the very soft focus background. The background lacks any detail which is no problem but the brighter green strip is somewhat distracting it would have been a lot better if you could have had more uniformity of colour either dark or light throughout. Given the lack of detail in the background I think a smaller aperture, say f8, would have given you more DOF in the flower without bringing out too much detail in the background. All in all a pleasing image Stuart, its a shame you didn''t have any other feedback...</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well You''ve struck the right note with the warm vibrant colours of the flower very typical Kodachrome. I like your off-centre composition it works well and is nicely isolated from the very soft focus background. The background lacks any detail which is no problem but the brighter green strip is somewhat distracting it would have been a lot better if you could have had more uniformity of colour either dark or light throughout. Given the lack of detail in the background I think a smaller aperture, say f8, would have given you more DOF in the flower without bringing out too much detail in the background. All in all a pleasing image Stuart, its a shame you didn''t have any other feedback...', '2018-06-07 12:02:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7570744, 1215149, 185714, '<td valign="top">Very impressive. Congrats on HM.</td>', 'Very impressive. Congrats on HM.', '2018-06-07 22:44:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7570766, 1214912, 156176, '<td valign="top">Great image.It really caught the feel of the color saturation of that film.</td>', 'Great image.It really caught the feel of the color saturation of that film.', '2018-06-08 00:26:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7570783, 1214854, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well look who the cat dragged back! Welcome back, JP. Nice work on the photo.</td>', 'Well look who the cat dragged back! Welcome back, JP. Nice work on the photo.', '2018-06-08 00:58:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7570982, 1214910, 27735, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone, this was a nice surprise! I hadn''t entered anything in quite a while, and this is the first entry with this lens. I shoot with old manual focus lenses now, most of which are not in the lens database. This one is though, photo was shot wide open with the Nikkor pre-AI 300mm f/4.5.</td>', 'Thanks everyone, this was a nice surprise! I hadn''t entered anything in quite a while, and this is the first entry with this lens. I shoot with old manual focus lenses now, most of which are not in the lens database. This one is though, photo was shot wide open with the Nikkor pre-AI 300mm f/4.5.', '2018-06-09 11:36:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7571098, 1215115, 172697, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the comments and votes :)</td>', 'Thank you for all the comments and votes :)', '2018-06-10 17:15:31.000000', NULL, 0);
